SUMMARY:Strangford langoustines — peak season
DESCRIPTION:Spring creel season is in full swing. Firm\, sweet\, unstressed
 . Pulled by hand from the lough floor — minutes from the boat to the harbo
 ur wall.\n\nCategory: seafood\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Ulster
URL:https://ulster.food/#season
CATEGORIES:Seafood
