DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260701
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Abernethy spring butter — peak season
DESCRIPTION:Hand-churned from single-farm cream out of the Lagan Valley. Sp
 ring cream is the richest of the year — the dulse and sea salt variety is 
 the one to seek out.\n\nCategory: dairy\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Ulster
URL:https://ulster.food/#season
CATEGORIES:Dairy
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
