DTSTAMP:20260603T155407Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260301
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260501
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:🌿 Wild garlic — peak season
DESCRIPTION:A brief\, intense window through March and April when the Count
 y Down woodlands go magnificently green and pungent. Forage the edges\, mi
 nd the bluebells\, get there before it flowers — by mid-May it's over for 
 the year.\n\nCategory: veg\nWild / foraged — please forage responsibly.\n\
 nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Ulster
URL:https://ulster.food/#season
CATEGORIES:Veg\,Foraged
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
