DTSTAMP:20260603T155407Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260801
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Comber Earlies — peak season
DESCRIPTION:PGI-protected new potatoes from the heavy clay soils around Com
 ber. First diggings expected late May. Boil for ten minutes\, smear with b
 utter\, salt heavily.\n\nCategory: veg\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Ulster
URL:https://ulster.food/#season
CATEGORIES:Veg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
