DTSTAMP:20260603T155407Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260701
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Asparagus — peak season
DESCRIPTION:A short\, glorious window. From small County Down market garden
 s — cut that morning\, on the plate that evening. The shorter the gap\, th
 e sweeter the spear.\n\nCategory: veg\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Ulster
URL:https://ulster.food/#season
CATEGORIES:Veg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
