DTSTAMP:20260603T155407Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260701
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260901
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Strawberries — peak season
DESCRIPTION:The County Down soft fruit season runs through summer with the 
 peak in July. Finlay's Place opens for pick-your-own — eat them warm from 
 the sun\, the day they're picked. Nothing in any supermarket comes close.\
 n\nCategory: fruit\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Ulster
URL:https://ulster.food/#season
CATEGORIES:Fruit
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
