DTSTAMP:20260603T155407Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Brown crab — peak season
DESCRIPTION:Crab season builds through summer and peaks in early autumn. Th
 e Kilkeel fleet lands brown and velvet — sweet white meat\, rich brown mea
 t\, both at their best from August.\n\nCategory: seafood\n\nFull guide at 
 ulster.food
LOCATION:Ulster
URL:https://ulster.food/#season
CATEGORIES:Seafood
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
