DTSTAMP:20260603T155407Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Heather honey — peak season
DESCRIPTION:Late summer brings the heather harvest from the Mournes and the
  higher ground. Dark\, thick\, intensely floral. The flagship Ulster honey
  of the year.\n\nCategory: honey\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Ulster
URL:https://ulster.food/#season
CATEGORIES:Honey
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
