DTSTAMP:20260603T155407Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Heritage apples — peak season
DESCRIPTION:Armagh is the orchard county of Ireland. Bramley for cooking\, 
 heritage varieties for eating — the harvest builds through September and r
 uns into winter storage.\n\nCategory: fruit\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Ulster
URL:https://ulster.food/#season
CATEGORIES:Fruit
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
