DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270301
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Venison — peak season
DESCRIPTION:Wild and farmed venison through the colder months — Finnebrogue
  Estate near Downpatrick is the County Down anchor. Lean\, deeply flavoure
 d\, the proper winter meat.\n\nCategory: meat\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Ulster
URL:https://ulster.food/#season
CATEGORIES:Meat
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
