DTSTAMP:20260603T155407Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260701
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:🌿 Elderflower — peak season
DESCRIPTION:The hedgerows along quiet County Down lanes are about to burst 
 into creamy elderflower clusters. A six-week window from late May for cord
 ial\, fritters and elderflower champagne. Pick on a dry sunny morning — th
 e scent doesn't keep.\n\nCategory: veg\nWild / foraged — please forage res
 ponsibly.\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Ulster
URL:https://ulster.food/#season
CATEGORIES:Veg\,Foraged
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
