DTSTAMP:20260603T155407Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260801
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:🎪 Royal Hillsborough Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:Three Saturdays each summer in the picturesque Dark Walk at Hil
 lsborough Fort. Over 50 stalls of the finest local and seasonal artisan fo
 od — regeneratively farmed meats\, fruit and veg\, breads\, Irish cheeses\
 , smoked salmon\, plus street food\, music and makers. In its 10th year in
  2026. Free to attend\, 10am–4pm.\n\nDates: Saturdays — 30 May\, 27 June\,
  25 July 2026\nFocus: Artisan food & drink\, makers\, street food\nMore in
 fo: https://www.visitlisburncastlereagh.com/whats-on/royal-hillsborough-fa
 rmers-market-p945431\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Hillsborough Fort\, Hillsborough
URL:https://www.visitlisburncastlereagh.com/whats-on/royal-hillsborough-far
 mers-market-p945431
CATEGORIES:Festival\,Market
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
