DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260701
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260801
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:🎪 Portaferry Gala Festival
DESCRIPTION:Portaferry's main summer community festival — a full week of ev
 ents through the village\, with food and drink stalls woven through alongs
 ide music\, family activities and waterfront entertainment.\n\nDates: 18–2
 4 July 2026\nFocus: Community food and drink\, summer waterfront\nMore inf
 o: https://www.portaferrygala.com/\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Portaferry\, Ards Peninsula
URL:https://www.portaferrygala.com/
