DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:🎪 Tide and Turf Portavogie
DESCRIPTION:Formerly the Portavogie Prawn Festival\, broadened to celebrate
  both the harbour's catch (prawns\, white fish) and the surrounding farmla
 nd (beef and produce). Free family event at the heart of the working harbo
 ur with chef demos and seafood throughout the day.\n\nDates: Saturday 12 S
 eptember 2026\nFocus: Portavogie prawns\, seafood and farmland beef\nMore 
 info: https://www.visitardsandnorthdown.com/whats-on/tide-and-turf-portavo
 gie-p799441\n\nFull guide at ulster.food
LOCATION:Portavogie Harbour\, Ards Peninsula
URL:https://www.visitardsandnorthdown.com/whats-on/tide-and-turf-portavogie
 -p799441
CATEGORIES:Festival\,Food
